WEBVTT

00:11:28.809 --> 00:11:31.145
We need to have these conversations.

00:11:31.186 --> 00:11:35.023
Legal contracts are sometimes written
to avoid looking eye to eye

00:11:35.065 --> 00:11:36.400
and coming to agreement.

00:11:36.817 --> 00:11:39.987
But family contracts should only
be written after you've done that.

00:11:40.904 --> 00:11:42.239
When I design relationships

00:11:42.281 --> 00:11:45.325
for polyamorous triads of three
or quads of four,

00:11:45.367 --> 00:11:47.953
I sometimes use existing legal structures

00:11:47.953 --> 00:11:50.122
like trusts or LLCs,

00:11:50.122 --> 00:11:52.249
that allow you to share
property and finances

00:11:52.291 --> 00:11:54.960
without a question
as to your relationship.

00:11:55.294 --> 00:11:57.963
So, for example, if I've got
a polyamorous triad

00:11:58.005 --> 00:11:59.715
Ayesha, Susan and Linda,

00:11:59.757 --> 00:12:01.884
I can set up an LLC for them